00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:19.458 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Hello, Mr. Snail!

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:22.333 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Aw, you cute little <i>Cornu aspersum</i>.

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:25.125 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Latin name—bonus points!

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.833 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Can’t believe we got stuck with the tree hugger.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:34.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
If I have to hear the Latin name for one more animal, I swear I’m gonna kill her.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:39.542 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Relax, Sugar Buns. While she does all the work we’ll have all the fun.

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:42.583 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Yeah! And get wasted out of our minds!

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.250 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Way ahead of you, man.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
C’mon, team! We mustn’t dilly-dally when there’s so much nature to see!

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:53.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
I was thinking we should call our class project “Fungis in a Forest!”

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.167 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Get it? Because we’re a group of fun guys.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:57.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
And also fungis, which—

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:02.458 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Shush! That’s a yellow wagtail. And she’s in distress!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.333 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
There, there, my little <i>Motacilla flava</i>.

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:10.042 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oh! Look at her go!

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:11.500 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Wow!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.417 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Out of the way, dorkwad! We’re camping here.

00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:17.500 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Finally! Time to get that barbecue burning.

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:20.167 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oh. Oh, dear.

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:28.875 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Gross!

00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:35.458 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oh. Easy, guys. We’re supposed to be studying nature, not wrecking it.

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.958 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Piss break!

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:44.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oi, fungus freak! Make yourself useful and fix the tent.

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:48.917 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oh, a bit of friendly campsite ribbing. Fun.

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.583 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
She wouldn’t survive five minutes alone in these woods.

00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:56.792 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Yeah. She’s a real weenie that one, innit?

00:01:56.792 --> 00:01:59.000 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Oi, Phil! How those sausages coming?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.458 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Almost ready! Just need a bit more salt...

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:39.208 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
It’s incredible. It’s a new species.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:41.875 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
What the bloody hell are those things?

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:44.542 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
It’s like a gnome shagged a mushroom.

00:02:57.375 --> 00:02:59.583 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
They’re absolutely adorable.

00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:02.000 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Yeah, absolutely bloody adorable.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
And I bet we’ll make a fortune if we catch one of those things.

00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:06.958 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
We’d be famous!

00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:08.292 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Get on MTV.

00:03:08.292 --> 00:03:09.875 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
I wonder what they taste like.

00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:12.500 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
We really shouldn’t disrupt their habitat.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.917 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Right. Sure, sure.

00:03:15.917 --> 00:03:17.500 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Greetings.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.000 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Welcome, friends.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.208 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
I’ll be right down.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.750 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Could I interest you in some peppermint tea?

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
What are you guys?

00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:34.417 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
We are sprites. We sprite balance to the forest.

00:03:34.417 --> 00:03:39.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
We take care of the animals, plants, birds, moss…

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.917 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Guys? Guys, I…

00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:51.542 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Hey, uh, little mushroom geezer, you cool with us camping here for the night?

00:03:51.542 --> 00:03:56.333 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Absolutely. A friend of the forest is a friend of the sprites.

00:03:57.708 --> 00:04:01.375 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Maybe it was just ketchup… or something… like…

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:09.125 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Red paint? Yeah, maybe they were just painting their little hats or... something...

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.041 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Guys?

00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:21.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Guys?

00:04:22.417 --> 00:04:23.957 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Guys, this isn’t funny.

00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:26.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Guys?

00:04:47.208 --> 00:04:50.167 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
We were just gonna catch one! But they’re psycho!

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.957 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
You gotta get me outta these! Hurry! They’re gonna kill us!

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:56.582 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Hurry!

00:04:56.583 --> 00:04:59.458 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Right foot, left foot, leaf and stone.

00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:03.583 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
You picked the wrong camping spot, bitches.

00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:05.292 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Sprite them!

00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:07.542 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Run!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.083 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Aaaah! My eyes!

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Sugar Buns! Help me!

00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:08.875 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Sweet cakes!

00:06:11.292 --> 00:06:13.207 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Love muffin...

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:15.667 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Huh?

00:06:40.042 --> 00:06:43.457 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
No, no, no! I can’t swim!

00:06:55.083 --> 00:06:56.875 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Yes!

00:06:58.292 --> 00:06:59.707 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
No!

00:07:06.359 --> 00:07:08.140 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Son of a spriteberry!

00:07:08.141 --> 00:07:09.608 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
It burns! It burns!

00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:16.208 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
I don’t want to hurt you! Just keep your distance!

00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:21.125 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
All right, then. Eat salt, you little green bastards!

00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:58.542 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Nuh-uh-uh.

00:07:58.542 --> 00:08:03.332 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Those punks treated the world as their own personal rubbish bin.

00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:05.625 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
And you set them free!

00:08:05.625 --> 00:08:07.833 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Now you’ll join them!

00:08:45.875 --> 00:08:49.167 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
I’ll give you that one, brother bird!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:55.417 line:66%,end position:43%,center size:70%
Alright, sprites, let’s burn the bodies and have some peppermint tea.
